Patient: Yes, I have.
Doctor: Great. Have you noticed any improvement in your symptoms?
Patient: I've had some intermittent abdominal symptoms, but I've been having more flare-ups lately.
Doctor: I see. Can you tell me more about what's been causing your flare-ups?
Patient: I recently ate shrimp and had some upper and lower abdominal pain and bloating. I also have diarrhea after eating chicken alfredo and drinking alcohol.
